---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ResearchCanvas from '../components/ResearchCanvas.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Ganlin Xiang · Physics, notes & little discoveries" description="Ganlin Xiang's bilingual personal blog about physics, LLM emergence, social thought, and semester study notes." active="home" language="zh-CN" canonicalPath="/">
  <main id="content" class="main"><div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">RUC · Rising junior in physics</span>
        <h1 class="display-title">Physics, notes<br />&amp; little <em>discoveries.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">你好，我是向柑潾（Ganlin Xiang），一名人民大学准大三的物理学本科生。我喜欢在物理的世界里知晓万物规律，也喜欢探索发现LLM的自我涌现机制，我还喜欢聊聊社会科学，哲学，社会现象。这是我的个人blog，每学期更新我的学习笔记。一起进步！</p>
        <p class="lede bilingual-en" lang="en">Hi, I’m Ganlin Xiang, a rising junior studying physics at Renmin University of China. I love learning how the universe works through physics, and I’m equally curious about the mechanisms behind emergent behavior in LLMs. I also enjoy conversations about the social sciences, philosophy, and the patterns we notice in society. This is my personal blog, where I update my study notes every semester. Let’s keep growing together.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/notes.html">Browse my notes <span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="button" href="/about.html">About me</a></div>
      </div>
      <ResearchCanvas />
    </section>
    <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-track"><span>二维材料 <i>✦</i></span><span>凝聚态物理 <i>✦</i></span><span>AI FOR SCIENCE <i>✦</i></span><span>数学物理方法 <i>✦</i></span><span>原子物理 <i>✦</i></span><span>PARAMETER-EFFICIENT FINE-TUNING <i>✦</i></span><span>二维材料 <i>✦</i></span><span>凝聚态物理 <i>✦</i></span><span>AI FOR SCIENCE <i>✦</i></span><span>数学物理方法 <i>✦</i></span><span>原子物理 <i>✦</i></span><span>PARAMETER-EFFICIENT FINE-TUNING <i>✦</i></span></div></div>

    <section class="section reveal" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <SectionHeading kicker="01 / Research orbit" title="Questions I keep chasing" id="focus-title" subtitle="Research interests are not a list of keywords, but a set of questions still taking shape." tag="CURRENT FOCUS" />
      <div class="focus-grid"><article class="focus-card"><span class="focus-number">MATTER / 01</span><h3>2D Materials<br />&amp; Condensed Matter</h3><p>I study the synthesis and characterization of two-dimensional materials, including the growth of transition-metal dichalcogenides such as MoS₂ inside optical fibers using all-liquid-phase precursors.</p></article><article class="focus-card ai"><span class="focus-number">MODEL / 02</span><h3>AI for<br />Science</h3><p>I explore deep learning, generative AI, and multimodal language models for scientific work, with a current interest in parameter-efficient fine-tuning and the emergence of model capabilities.</p></article></div>
      <div class="tech-stack-panel"><div class="tech-stack-label">Knowledge base &amp; toolchain</div><div class="tech-chips"><span class="chip">理论力学</span><span class="chip">电磁学</span><span class="chip">原子物理</span><span class="chip">光学</span><span class="chip chip-math">线性代数</span><span class="chip chip-math">数学物理方法</span><span class="chip chip-math">蒙特卡洛</span><span class="chip chip-code">Python</span><span class="chip chip-code">MATLAB</span><span class="chip chip-code">PyTorch</span><span class="chip chip-tool">LaTeX</span></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section reveal" aria-labelledby="now-title">
      <SectionHeading kicker="02 / On my desk" title="What I’m studying" id="now-title" subtitle="Recent entries from my personal knowledge base, organized during the Spring 2026 semester." tag="LIVE NOTEBOOK" />
      <div class="now-grid"><article class="now-card"><div class="now-meta"><span>ATOMIC PHYSICS</span><span>01</span></div><h3>精细结构与自旋</h3><p>从轨道磁矩、Larmor 进动到 Stern–Gerlach 实验，建立角动量量子化的连贯图像。</p></article><article class="now-card"><div class="now-meta"><span>QUANTUM STATES</span><span>02</span></div><h3>泡利原理与多电子原子</h3><p>为什么单态与三重态拥有相反的空间对称性，以及这件事如何决定原子光谱。</p></article><article class="now-card"><div class="now-meta"><span>MATH METHODS</span><span>03</span></div><h3>Sturm–Liouville 谱</h3><p>把矩阵本征值问题搬到函数空间，理解边界条件、正交性与广义 Fourier 展开。</p></article></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section reveal" aria-labelledby="journal-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">03 / Selected notes</span><h2 class="section-title" id="journal-title">Selected notes</h2><p class="section-subtitle">Derivations, physical intuition, and the “why” that finally clicked.</p></div><a class="button" href="/notes.html">View all notes <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="tile-grid"><a href="/posts/atomic-fine-structure-spin.html" class="tile"><div class="tile-tag">原子物理 · NEW</div><div class="tile-title">精细结构、磁矩<br />与电子自旋</div><div class="tile-meta">2026.05 · 8 min read</div></a><a href="/posts/pauli-principle.html" class="tile"><div class="tile-tag">多电子原子 · NEW</div><div class="tile-title">泡利不相容原理<br />与交换对称性</div><div class="tile-meta">2026.05 · 9 min read</div></a><a href="/posts/sturm-liouville.html" class="tile"><div class="tile-tag">数学物理 · NEW</div><div class="tile-title">Sturm–Liouville<br />本征值问题</div><div class="tile-meta">2026.05 · 10 min read</div></a></div>
    </section>
  </div></main>
</BaseLayout>
